1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,204
Di sana ada yang kuinginkan.

2
00:00:01,262 --> 00:00:01,910
Sebuah keluarga.

3
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:04,660
Poin suka A-Ling, enam puluh satu.

4
00:00:05,487 --> 00:00:06,990
Jawaban macam apa itu…

5
00:00:07,114 --> 00:00:09,697
Poin suka ketiga istri

6
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:11,693
semuanya tembus enam puluh.

7
00:00:12,659 --> 00:00:14,987
Hadiah utama terbuka.

8
00:00:16,618 --> 00:00:19,850
Hadiah utama: resep mesiu.

9
00:00:19,938 --> 00:00:20,256
Mesiu…

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,486
Dengan ini,

11
00:00:23,609 --> 00:00:25,553
siapa berani menangkap keluargaku?

12
00:00:27,726 --> 00:00:28,746
Tapi ini juga bisa

13
00:00:28,803 --> 00:00:30,241
membunuh banyak orang.

14
00:00:32,892 --> 00:00:33,638
Segel.

15
00:00:33,696 --> 00:00:34,952
Aku sendiri pun tak akan membukanya.

16
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:37,809
Segel dikonfirmasi.

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,192
Kau memikirkan apa?

18
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:42,339
Sesuatu yang bisa membunuh banyak orang.

19
00:00:42,794 --> 00:00:44,237
Kukunci dulu.

20
00:00:46,472 --> 00:00:47,226
Kunci baik-baik.

21
00:00:50,072 --> 00:00:50,471
Meriah begini,

22
00:00:51,001 --> 00:00:52,971
lebih ramai dari kota prefektur.

23
00:00:53,612 --> 00:00:54,994
Liuxi kita

24
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:57,221
punya juara pertama ujian provinsi!

25
00:00:57,296 --> 00:00:58,429
Kakak!

26
00:00:58,496 --> 00:00:59,983
Kak A-Ling bilang,

27
00:01:00,052 --> 00:01:01,662
Kakak pasti pulang!

28
00:01:02,155 --> 00:01:03,334
Kak A-Ling!

29
00:01:05,913 --> 00:01:07,821
Tu-Tuan Juara…

30
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,114
Tuan Qian,

31
00:01:09,894 --> 00:01:11,280
sujud yang dijanjikan—

32
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:14,326
Sa-saya…

33
00:01:14,403 --> 00:01:15,037
Tak usah.

34
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:17,254
Membungkuk saja cukup.

35
00:01:18,889 --> 00:01:19,615
Hitungan ini,

36
00:01:20,266 --> 00:01:22,385
akhirnya lunas juga.

37
00:01:24,173 --> 00:01:24,427
Kakak,

38
00:01:25,059 --> 00:01:26,989
juara pertama ujian provinsi itu apa?

39
00:01:27,067 --> 00:01:27,617
Artinya mulai sekarang,

40
00:01:28,016 --> 00:01:29,422
tak ada yang berani menindasmu.

41
00:01:29,485 --> 00:01:30,581
Nona Tang!

42
00:01:31,487 --> 00:01:33,724
Surat kilat dari ibu kota!

43
00:01:34,074 --> 00:01:35,463
Wei Shaoqing…

44
00:01:35,522 --> 00:01:36,821
membawa sebuah potret,

45
00:01:37,598 --> 00:01:38,519
masuk ke kediaman perdana menteri.
